== What *local first* sounds like when the Wi-Fi blinks

#badge-shipped[
  The architecture does not require the public internet to produce the next paragraph.
  That matters during storms, travel, or a bad month of bandwidth.
]

When the network stutters, a cloud story factory hiccups. A local stack still asks only whether the fan can keep up.

#pull-quote[
  Novelmate marketing promises queue style runs, not infinite instant ink. That honesty protects trust.
]

#pagebreak()

== Why exports matter more than chatty paragraphs

#badge-shipped[
  Markdown, EPUB, DOCX, and PDF oriented flows exist because books are *files with responsibilities*.
]

Editors, friends, proofreaders, and future you do not live inside a chat bubble forever.
They live in attachments, readers, margin notes, and calm cups of tea.

