== The difference between a demo and a pipeline

Demos are fireworks. Pipelines are plumbing.

#badge-beta[
  Packaging scripts, smoke tests, and a package contract are the boring hero work.
  They say: we are trying to be responsible, not merely viral.
]

If your son talks about CI like it matters, translate it to: *he wants the thing to work when nobody is watching*.

#pagebreak()

== What to say when a relative says *A I will steal jobs*

The better frame is stewardship.

Someone still decides what the book values.
Someone still carries the moral weight of scenes.
Someone still rewrites the sentences that ring false at midnight.

#badge-roadmap[
  Collaboration features, if they arrive, must honor consent and clarity.
  The roadmap section is where imagination stays humble.
]

