== Proof that craft language shows up in code, not only in ads

Humanizing JSON and style research packs are nerd poetry.
They are an attempt to keep prose from flattening into the same tired gestures.

#badge-shipped[
  Humanizing heuristics and research packs influence prose and polish behavior.
