== A short list of things that are *not* promises in this booklet

- A guaranteed national book tour (roadmap at best).
- A guarantee of flawless prose on the first run (beta truth: iteration wins).
- A guarantee that anyone can install without reading (packaging is getting better; humility remains).

#v(0.12in)

== A short list of things that *are* fair to celebrate tonight

- A working theory of long form generation that respects custody.
- A pipeline skeleton that can carry a project from premise toward export artifacts.
- A stubborn insistence on labeling roadmap dreams honestly.

#pull-quote[
  Pride does not require perfection. It requires direction with integrity.
]

